<h1 align="center">Hey there ! 👋 I'm {{ profile.name }}</h1>

<p align="center">
  <em>{{ lang.bio }}</em>
</p>

<p align="center">
  {% if profile.location %}
  <img src="{{ badge('Location '~profile.location, 'blue', {logo: 'googlemaps'}) }}" alt="{{ profile.location }}"/>
  {% endif %}
  {% for social in socials %}
  {{ badge_link(social.url, social.label, social.color, {logo: social.icon})|raw }}
  {% endfor %}
  {{ badge_link('https://ktherage.github.io/', 'Blog EN', 'blue', {logo: 'googlechrome'})|raw }}
  {{ badge_link('https://ktherage.github.io/fr/', 'Blog FR', 'blue', {logo: 'googlechrome'})|raw }}
</p>

---

## 🧑‍💻 About Me

- 🔭 I'm currently working on **{{ profile.company }}**
- 🌱 I'm currently learning **{{ lang.learning|join(', ') }}**
- 💬 Ask me about **{{ lang.ask_me_about|join(', ') }}**
- ⚡ Fun fact: *{{ lang.fun_fact }}*

---

## 🛠️ Tech Stack

<p align="center">
  {% for l in languages %}
  <img src="{{ lang_badge(l.name, l.color, l.percentage) }}" alt="{{ l.name }}"/>
  {% endfor %}
</p>

---

## 📊 GitHub Stats

<p align="center">
  <img src="https://github-readme-stats.vercel.app/api?username={{ profile.login }}&show_icons=true&theme=tokyonight&hide_border=true" alt="GitHub Stats"/>
  <img src="https://github-readme-streak-stats.herokuapp.com/?user={{ profile.login }}&theme=tokyonight&hide_border=true" alt="Streak Stats"/>
</p>

