## 🏆 Top Projects

| Project | Description | ⭐ |
|---------|-------------|-----|
{% for repo in top_repos %}
| [{{ repo.name }}]({{ repo.html_url }}) | {{ repo.description|truncate(80) }} | {{ repo.stargazers_count }} |
{% endfor %}

